          "title": "You'll want to know: educar",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "educar — \"to bring up, to educate\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Os meus pais educaram-nos com muito carinho. My parents brought us up with a lot of love."
            },
